<title>USA: K&amp;G Men's files for 1.2 mln shr offer.</title>
<headline>K&amp;G Men's files for 1.2 mln shr offer.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>K&amp;G Men's Center Inc said on Tuesday that it filed a registration statement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for a 1.2 million public share offering.</p>
<p>The company said it would offer 313,850 shares and certain shareholders would offer 886,150 shares. Robinson-Humphrey Co Inc, J.C. Bradford &amp; Co and Interstate/Johnson Lane Corp were managing the synicate of underwriters, K&amp;G said.</p>
<p>K&amp;G is a superstore retailer of men's apparel and accessories.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
